abstract: "Data appendix to a September 2026 article in The Conversation on Philadelphia traffic fatalities. Compares Philadelphia with New York, Chicago, Washington and Boston and with the 40 largest US cities using FARS 2015-2024 microdata (NHTSA), PennDOT crash reporting system data 2015-2024, and Census population estimates for denominators."
